  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Poskytnutie finan&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho pr&#xed;spevku resuscita&#x10d;no-zdravotn&#xed;ckemu modulu na vstupno-v&#xfd;stupnom bode v Stanici Luhanskej</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a financial contribution to the resuscitation-medical module at the Luhansk Station</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Core contribution shall be used for the activities related to the emergency first-aid post at Exit-Entry Checkpoint (EECP) in Stanytsya Luhanska (Government Controlled Area).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Poskytnutie finan&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho pr&#xed;spevku v sume 30 000 eur na &#xfa;hradu miezd lek&#xe1;rov a obslu&#x17e;n&#xe9;ho person&#xe1;lu resuscita&#x10d;no-zdravotn&#xed;ckeho modulu, zriaden&#xe9;ho v r&#xe1;mci SlovakAid, na vstupno-v&#xfd;stupnom bode v Stanici Luhanskej a na n&#xe1;kup potrebn&#xfd;ch lie&#x10d;iv a zdravotn&#xed;ckych pom&#xf4;cok</narrative>
  </description>
